WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:02.659
Alex Sol, Actor/Director: Fundamentally the
most common thing you would get in the beginning

00:00:02.659 --> 00:00:08.240
before you got somebody really excited for
you for whatever reason is…they would open

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:09.430
the meeting like this:

00:00:09.430 --> 00:00:12.440
“You know I don’t really have a place
for you.

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:13.970
I don’t really have a place for you.”

00:00:13.970 --> 00:00:15.200
This is the opening of the meeting.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.430
So you’ve sat down “Hey, Alex how you
are doing?

00:00:18.430 --> 00:00:24.070
Great…so you were in American History X…Yes…yeah
great…I love that director.

00:00:24.070 --> 00:00:25.570
Yeah…yeah…me, too.

00:00:25.570 --> 00:00:26.840
He’s great.”

00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:31.000
And then fundamentally you just really want
to say “What are we doing here?

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.042
What’s the point of this?

00:00:32.042 --> 00:00:33.042
Do you want me?

00:00:33.042 --> 00:00:34.042
Do you not want me?”

00:00:34.042 --> 00:00:35.770
I want the meeting to go like that.

00:00:35.770 --> 00:00:37.920
What do you want to do?”

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:43.510
I wish it were more direct but so the opening
statement would be this…then we’d get

00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:48.820
through all the niceties and then “I’m
not going to be able to take you.”

00:00:48.820 --> 00:00:50.969
And then we go on for another 40 minutes of
the meeting.

00:00:50.969 --> 00:00:56.110
That’s a real horrible feeling because at
that point for me I just want to say “That’s

00:00:56.110 --> 00:00:57.110
cool.

00:00:57.110 --> 00:00:58.420
I respect that.

00:00:58.420 --> 00:00:59.770
I’d like to leave now.

00:00:59.770 --> 00:01:01.670
But you can’t do that.

00:01:01.670 --> 00:01:06.090
So you have to sit there and do this ridiculousness
for another half an hour as you’re sitting

00:01:06.090 --> 00:01:10.819
there going I’d have to talk to you if you
just told me you want nothing to do with me.

00:01:10.819 --> 00:01:12.159
So yeah, those are annoying things.

